    "long_instructions": "## Operations Manager\r\n\r\nThe manager needs an AI chatbot agent to help their Gaming Lounge customers. Build and test it for them.\r\n\r\n##### Do This:\r\n\r\n1. Write a TaCoFoRT system prompt for your bot.\r\n2. Add a line telling your bot to stay on topic — if someone asks something unrelated to your business, it should politely decline.\r\n3. Test your bot with three questions:\r\n   - One your prompt and Retrieval cover\r\n   - One they don't cover\r\n   - One totally unrelated to your business\r\n4. Debug: Based on what happened, revise your system prompt or Retrieval cards.\r\n5. Test again.\r\n\r\n::: details [**Need a reminder of the TaCoFoRT elements?**]\r\n- Task — what should this bot help customers do?\r\n- Context — what's the business, and what's the bot's role?\r\n- Format — short answers, step-by-step, or something else?\r\n- Retrieval — what additional details, examples or resources should you add?\r\n- Tone — pick what fits the business.\r\n:::\r\n",
